579
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:18,480
He came to her like they always do.

580
00:19:16,320 --> 00:19:19,760
The agents are stunned by it.

581
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:21,400
They start calling you for the

582
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:22,960
impossible cases.

583
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:25,600
You make more money than you ever

584
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:27,480
imagined as a kid in a basement. But the

585
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:29,960
work is darker now.

586
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:31,880
The men you hunt are killers.

587
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:33,560
Some are connected to organizations that

588
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:35,640
do not forgive.

589
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:37,640
You start watching your own back.

590
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:40,240
You vary your routes home.

591
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:42,200
You check your car before you start it.

592
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:44,120
The hunter has become aware that he can

593
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:46,560
be hunted, too.

594
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:49,000
By now, your marriage is over.

595
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:50,560
Maria filed the papers a year ago.

596
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:52,480
You did not fight it.

597
00:19:50,560 --> 00:19:54,560
You knew that she was right.

598
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:55,760
You missed too many dinners and too many

599
00:19:54,560 --> 00:19:58,200
years.

600
00:19:55,760 --> 00:19:59,840
Sophia is in college now. She barely

601
00:19:58,200 --> 00:20:02,400
speaks to you anymore.

602
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:05,560
You send money she does not ask for.

603
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:08,040
You send texts she rarely answers.

604
00:20:05,560 --> 00:20:10,160
You have caught hundreds of fugitives.

605
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:11,640
You have lost the only two people who

606
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:13,520
ever mattered.

607
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:14,720
You sit alone in hotel rooms cleaning

608
00:20:13,520 --> 00:20:16,720
your gun.

609
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:18,120
You wonder how the gas station kid ended

610
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:19,760
up here.

611
00:20:18,120 --> 00:20:21,920
You think about Danny, who became a

612
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:23,600
teacher and has a family.

613
00:20:21,920 --> 00:20:25,320
You think about the ordinary life you

614
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:26,760
traded away.

615
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:29,880
You are at the very top of your

616
00:20:26,760 --> 00:20:31,360
profession, and you have never felt more

617
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:33,960
alone.

618
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:36,040
Level nine, the legend.

619
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:38,080
You don't chase men anymore. Your body

620
00:20:36,040 --> 00:20:39,720
simply will not let you.

621
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:40,880
The old injuries have piled up over the

622
00:20:39,720 --> 00:20:43,280
decades.

623
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:45,040
The knife scar aches in cold weather.

624
00:20:43,280 --> 00:20:46,200
Your knees are shot from a thousand foot

625
00:20:45,040 --> 00:20:47,760
chases.

626
00:20:46,200 --> 00:20:49,640
Your shoulder never healed right from a

627
00:20:47,760 --> 00:20:52,720
fall off a fence.

628
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:54,840
You are 53, and you feel much older.

629
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:56,800
But your name means something now.

630
00:20:54,840 --> 00:20:58,320
In the world of fugitive recovery, you

631
00:20:56,800 --> 00:21:00,680
are a legend.

632
00:20:58,320 --> 00:21:02,760
The young hunters all know who you are.

633
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:05,200
They have heard the stories. The capture

634
00:21:02,760 --> 00:21:06,800
in Mexico. The six-year fugitive found

635
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:08,400
in three weeks.

636
00:21:06,800 --> 00:21:09,880
The hundreds of cases that nobody else

637
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:11,440
could close.

638
00:21:09,880 --> 00:21:13,720
You become a teacher.

639
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:15,520
You open your own training academy.

640
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:16,840
You teach the next generation what Frank

641
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:18,320
taught you.

642
00:21:16,840 --> 00:21:19,320
You teach them what you learned the hard

643
00:21:18,320 --> 00:21:20,760
way.

644
00:21:19,320 --> 00:21:21,960
You teach them to talk before they

645
00:21:20,760 --> 00:21:23,440
fight.

646
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:25,320
You teach them that finding the person

647
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:26,920
is the real skill.

648
00:21:25,320 --> 00:21:28,280
You teach them to read a door before

649
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:29,680
they open it.

650
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:31,760
You teach them the lesson that took you

651
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:33,800
decades to understand.

652
00:21:31,760 --> 00:21:34,960
The job will take everything if you let

653
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:36,800
it.

654
00:21:34,960 --> 00:21:38,280
You tell them about Frank.

655
00:21:36,800 --> 00:21:41,440
You tell them about the gas station and

656
00:21:38,280 --> 00:21:43,040
the card and the man who opened a door.

657
00:21:41,440 --> 00:21:44,560
You watch your students go out and build

658
00:21:43,040 --> 00:21:46,760
their own careers.

659
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:49,360
Some of them become great hunters.

660
00:21:46,760 --> 00:21:51,360
A few of them die doing this work.

661
00:21:49,360 --> 00:21:53,120
You go to the funerals. You give the

662
00:21:51,360 --> 00:21:54,760
eulogies now.

663
00:21:53,120 --> 00:21:57,320
You have become the old man at the back

664
00:21:54,760 --> 00:21:59,240
of the room that everyone respects.

665
00:21:57,320 --> 00:22:01,280
You also do some television.

666
00:21:59,240 --> 00:22:02,760
A producer wants to film real fugitive

667
00:22:01,280 --> 00:22:04,480
recoveries.

668
00:22:02,760 --> 00:22:06,800
You become a face that people recognize

669
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:08,120
on the street. Strangers ask you for

670
00:22:06,800 --> 00:22:09,880
photos.

671
00:22:08,120 --> 00:22:11,760
It is strange to be famous for a life

672
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:13,400
lived in shadows.

673
00:22:11,760 --> 00:22:15,000
The money is good and the work is

674
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:16,440
finally safe.

675
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:17,880
You tell yourself you have earned the

676
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:20,240
rest.

677
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:21,800
But the house is so quiet now.

678
00:22:20,240 --> 00:22:24,840
You live alone.

679
00:22:21,800 --> 00:22:26,320
Sophia is 24 years old. She sends a text

680
00:22:24,840 --> 00:22:28,720
