687
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:41,880
You spent your whole life finding people

688
00:22:39,520 --> 00:22:43,480
who didn't want to be found.

689
00:22:41,880 --> 00:22:45,520
You don't know how to find your way back

690
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:48,360
to your own daughter.

691
00:22:45,520 --> 00:22:50,320
Level 10, the ghost.

692
00:22:48,360 --> 00:22:52,200
You are 60 years old now.

693
00:22:50,320 --> 00:22:54,760
You don't carry a gun anymore.

694
00:22:52,200 --> 00:22:57,160
The academy runs without you most days.

695
00:22:54,760 --> 00:22:58,880
You sold the bail business years ago.

696
00:22:57,160 --> 00:23:00,040
You live in a quiet house outside the

697
00:22:58,880 --> 00:23:02,000
city.

698
00:23:00,040 --> 00:23:04,160
The chases are over.

699
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:07,480
The capturing is done.

700
00:23:04,160 --> 00:23:09,040
What is left is the silence.

701
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:10,160
You sit on your porch in the evening and

702
00:23:09,040 --> 00:23:11,680
you think.

703
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:14,400
You think about all the men you brought

704
00:23:11,680 --> 00:23:16,280
back over the years. Hundreds of them.

705
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:17,480
Faces you can still see when you close

706
00:23:16,280 --> 00:23:19,200
your eyes.

707
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:20,560
Some of them deserved everything that

708
00:23:19,200 --> 00:23:22,640
came next.

709
00:23:20,560 --> 00:23:24,240
Some of them were just scared and poor

710
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:26,080
and out of options.

711
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:28,160
You never let yourself wonder about that

712
00:23:26,080 --> 00:23:30,240
when you were young and hungry.

713
00:23:28,160 --> 00:23:31,520
Now there is nothing but time to wonder

714
00:23:30,240 --> 00:23:33,520
about it.

715
00:23:31,520 --> 00:23:35,560
You think about Frank who opened a door

716
00:23:33,520 --> 00:23:37,200
for a lost kid and never asked for

717
00:23:35,560 --> 00:23:38,880
anything back.

718
00:23:37,200 --> 00:23:40,440
You think about the team you led, the

719
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:42,320
people who trusted you to bring them

720
00:23:40,440 --> 00:23:44,440
home alive.

721
00:23:42,320 --> 00:23:46,560
You think about Maria who loved you when

722
00:23:44,440 --> 00:23:48,120
you had nothing and left you when you

723
00:23:46,560 --> 00:23:50,920
had everything.

724
00:23:48,120 --> 00:23:52,480
You earned every bit of that ending and

725
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:53,880
you have finally stopped pretending

726
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:56,200
otherwise.

727
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:57,800
The job gave you money and a name and a

728
00:23:56,200 --> 00:24:00,680
reputation that outlived your

729
00:23:57,800 --> 00:24:04,040
usefulness. It took your marriage, your

730
00:24:00,680 --> 00:24:06,400
years, and very nearly your daughter.

731
00:24:04,040 --> 00:24:08,240
You made a trade at 21 that you were far

732
00:24:06,400 --> 00:24:10,680
